    <artifactId>homing-preferences</artifactId>
    <description>
        User preferences: a rigid tree of nodes, each with a widget provider,
        stamped into a registry module per site; a view with a master slot
        and a detail slot that loads a node's widget the first time the node
        is chosen, and the widgets for the kinds a preference comes in -
        choice, toggle, scale - plus a group's overview. Every widget writes
        through the steward and follows it; the view holds and operates
        them, and nothing carries a channel. On the component base, the
        elements, the rigid tree and its writer.
    </description>
